  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SWITCH to Circular Economy Value Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The initiative promotes the adoption of circular economy practices in selected value chains, green and decent job creation, and the green economy transition. It targets private sector operators, notably Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) and local financial institutions&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
